# Lucide icons

UI icons: **only** [Lucide](https://lucide.dev/icons/) via `lucide-react`.

```tsx
import { Search, Settings, SearchX, ShieldOff } from 'lucide-react'
```

## Do

- Named imports from `lucide-react`
- Match stroke to shell chrome (`currentColor` / CSS color on the SVG)
- Status pages: `SearchX` (404), `ShieldOff` (403)

## Do not

- Use emoji as primary UI icons (buttons, nav, status cards)
- Add another icon pack (Font Awesome, Heroicons, etc.)

## Exception

Language switcher country marks may stay regional-indicator **flag emoji** (product preference for ISO country glyphs).
